{"id":"vi_a","lemma":"vía","pos":"noun","rank":2015,"glosses":["way, means","avenue, way, path","road"],"ipa":"/ˈbia/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"vías"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0c/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Eavqwiki-v%C3%ADa.wav","formAudio":{"vías":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e8/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Eavqwiki-v%C3%ADas.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Ahora estás en vías de recuperación.","en":"You're now on the way to recovery.","words":[{"g":"now"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"in / on"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"retrieval"}]},{"text":"No había vías férreas.","en":"There were no railroads.","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"makes pluperfect to…"},null,null]},{"text":"Tom tomó la vía incorrecta.","en":"Tom went the wrong way.","words":[null,{"g":"to take","l":"tomar"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"wrong, incorrect","l":"incorrecto"}]},{"text":"Fui a Londres vía París.","en":"I went to London by way of Paris.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/707206","words":[{"g":"to go","l":"ir"},{"g":"to"},null,null,{"g":"to give birth","l":"parir"}]},{"text":"Nuestra galaxia se llama Vía Láctea.","en":"Our galaxy is called the Milky Way.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/589868","words":[{"g":"our, ours, to us","l":"nuestro"},{"g":"galaxy"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"flame"},null,{"g":"milky","l":"lácteo"}]}]}